{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "df56f58e5a310dadb3ed400baba317b3df0e7116840ceabed8f6dad2e2be7621", "ja": "Coolミュージックストア！", "zh": "Cool音乐商店！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "40751f9c04ef940641fddffd422236b1107e4870041b793f527171398822f639", "ja": "イベント公演で簡単な楽器を演奏する事にな\nり、楽器店にやってきた一行。偶然出会った\nジュリアからアドバイスをもらう。相変らず\nの亜利沙は隠し撮りを咎められたりしながら\nも、とにかくそれぞれの楽器が決定した。", "zh": "活动演出要演奏简单的乐器，大家于是来到了乐器店。偶然遇见了\n茱莉亚，并从对方那里得到了建议。亚利沙还是老样子，一边因偷拍被训斥，\n不过总之，大家各自要演奏的乐器都决定下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0276bc0baaa142ddefa5b3046f38e79bd6186ffc9867ef6449deade834929ee4", "ja": "（可奈のアドバイスを受けて、野外イベントには\n簡単な楽器演奏を取り入れることにした！）", "zh": "（听取可奈的建议后，决定在户外活动中加入简单的乐器演奏！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7713f88daea49a0285e2f038c017e381c74810d171163ff10b825198a262bbad", "ja": "（必要なのは、もちろん……）", "zh": "（当然，需要的就是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "7df246ea6893bb120598e70c1c139360c6e3505b738688c868236debf913fa37", "ja": "わあ、楽器を売ってるお店までこんなに大きいのかい？\nやっぱし、都会はすごいねぇ……。", "zh": "哇，连卖乐器的店都这么大呀？  \n果然，大城市真厉害呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "1a1e8aac971e715850aff53b639ddbf03a87cd27c0f088e4b909e2f789ed789d", "ja": "ここは、その筋では有名なお店らしいですよ。\nやっぱり雰囲気がありますね……！", "zh": "听说这里是业内很有名的店呢。\n果然很有氛围……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "60a0fb75cf68974d57b0418d9a54a35d76b76f85b2755e358496f05e7e4145ce", "ja": "思った以上に色々揃ってるのね。楽器屋さんなんて\n滅多に来ないから、ちょっと新鮮だわ。", "zh": "这里的品种比想象中还要齐全呢。我平时\n很少来乐器店，感觉还挺新鲜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "b49b04fb058ec2fba5b6b653c511eb515d7f27c2ede07a14fc7f2634d3d15c2d", "ja": "たくさんあって、目移りしちゃいますね。\nところで、どうやって楽器を決めるんですか？", "zh": "有这么多，真让人挑花眼呢。话说回来，要怎么挑选乐器呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "33e0aae6fb1017c970bc26acf002654410cf14774dd988e9982746f1c5f0e36f", "ja": "そうだな。ひとまず、好みでいいんじゃないかな？\nみんなで店内をぶらついてみよう。", "zh": "是啊。暂时先按自己的喜好来，不就好了吗？\n大家一起在店里逛逛吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "3f4e7ba1c0212b585563843b5b1b7143bcbf3eabde1c3801d53573f453d7bd25", "ja": "う～ん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0c64310867e688f0d8f097be57d8bfd8ebcc96be5721e755b2d94fdfae074c55", "ja": "美奈子、どうしたんだ？　さっきからずっと\n立ち止まってるけど……気になる楽器が見つかったか？", "zh": "美奈子，怎么了？从刚才开始你就一直站在这里……是找到什么感兴趣的乐器了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "b0a78a28140b90f5d57b642838c86b4512319ac387d277b0e4309168ac7273a8", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n実は私、一目惚れしちゃった楽器が……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n其实，我对一件乐器一见钟情了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1010_p", "source_sha256": "62da2f02cca08d2056d3f1e7c684575ce65d867cd3ed14966604791ba75267f0", "ja": "おお、ピンと来るものがあったか。\nで、どの楽器だ？", "zh": "哦，有让你一见钟情的乐器吗？\n是哪种乐器？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "37cdcefcec895b45aac8658118b3b3f35eaae1c126e6beea95764d23adf3d3b6", "ja": "はい！　金管楽器の、チューバです！\nとっても素敵だと思いませんか？", "zh": "是的！是铜管乐器中的大号！\n您不觉得它的外形非常棒吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "3d88fee708a444872b15a13ad5433df043093a11dd9aae9fdf5428f30f594b23", "ja": "どっしりとしていて、それでいて丸い……！\n思わず抱きしめたくなるフォルムですよね♪", "zh": "稳重厚实，却又圆滚滚的……！\n这个外形是不是让人忍不住想抱一抱呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cb5757b42deadff4222e10ad718d18c3b3d2a5c3ebd287454c972526cb552c92", "ja": "フォルム……。まあ、見た目も大事な要素ではあるか。\nけど、金管楽器って……。", "zh": "外形……嗯，外观确实也是很重要的要素。\n不过，铜管乐器……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "749aeac2f514e97307b7eb1526818c01316f074c6016d3da521f31763c87cc9b", "ja": "そうねぇ。美奈子がチューバなら、\n私はシンセサイザーなんていいんじゃないかしら？", "zh": "是啊……如果美奈子是大号，那我用合成器之类的不是挺好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "ba04f25d1ce7948d3c9a297caa2924a3282169677c4b95ced6a3e12598527479", "ja": "あ、ありさ、ちょっとわかるカモです！\nシンセサイザー、かっこいいですよね！", "zh": "啊，亚利沙好像有点明白了！\n合成器，很帅气对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "d13c5bcf83b5cbd20637abdad79d054b495ae5bc2c2b66259e5e7832c841a5a3", "ja": "でしょう？　こういう計器っぽい、\n物理的なボタンを操るのって、ロマンがあるわよねぇ。", "zh": "对吧？操控这种仪器般的实体按钮，很有浪漫情怀呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "fcfac8181e0285026b2ea028487db5457ee9e2857557c76e09e1c31b1c14b30f", "ja": "それに、一台で色んな音が出せるなんて便利だし、\n曲のアレンジだってできちゃうし……。", "zh": "而且一台设备就能发出各种各样的声音，很方便，还能编曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "73804424ba4f7e5ac93a1f27e9e1347e797fa7a5f50224cabd3f2e0fab117c8e", "ja": "はい！　ライブでしか聞けないアレンジバージョンも、\nアイドルちゃんライブの楽しみのひとつですね！", "zh": "是的！只有在现场才能听到的特别编曲版本，也是偶像们现场演出的乐趣之一呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "ee5cb17fd5f2cf654358f78895380534cf57cefa10ae56ffa0b7df8aa426f4c9", "ja": "アレンジバージョン、いいわね♪\nアドリブで、シンセサイザーのソロなんてどうかしら？", "zh": "改编版本，不错呢♪\n即兴来一段合成器独奏，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d3bf5eaa3c8b4916202cf4a9ba79ea3d88e90e7d8c381d2945f12bc0e366b20f", "ja": "いきなりアドリブパートの事を考えるのは、\n流石に気が早いというか……。", "zh": "突然就开始考虑即兴部分，未免也太早了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "15ab2aa3d396b0bfb6ea8fcbb4b79b7f981c22f35acc7afb17bf804ee7fddc56", "ja": "ねえ、ひなたちゃんは？\nお気に入りの楽器、何か見つかった？", "zh": "对了，日向呢？\n找到喜欢的乐器了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "4149f9389a1235f89566155fca8098f596d5b8238a86133e73c6c758cc46e027", "ja": "うーん、そうだねぇ……。\n並んでる楽器、どれも素敵だと思うんだけども……。", "zh": "嗯——怎么说呢……\n我觉得摆在这里的乐器都很棒，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "63fa18dcacaf886814656a5380fb83d014eb3a0bb533b9163e5161d7e087c850", "ja": "イベントでやるには、\nあたしにはちょっこし難しそうだべさ。えへへ。", "zh": "要在活动上演奏的话，对我来说好像有点难呢。嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "dd64f4a5b653f7f2d0a46a7face8239f04bafad1cb2dabfd4404ed16d78ec5a4", "ja": "はっ！", "zh": "啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "dd64f4a5b653f7f2d0a46a7face8239f04bafad1cb2dabfd4404ed16d78ec5a4", "ja": "はっ！", "zh": "啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "dd64f4a5b653f7f2d0a46a7face8239f04bafad1cb2dabfd4404ed16d78ec5a4", "ja": "はっ！", "zh": "啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1027_p", "source_sha256": "5b181e093bc43ba2a15f4fa598648c17e62c54cc05ff4dd77b3335d0bf203114", "ja": "うん、ひなたの言う通りだ。みんな、\n今回の公演を考えた上で、改めて楽器を……ん？", "zh": "嗯，就像日向说的那样。大家在考虑了这次公演之后，再重新拿起乐器……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "3c477afdf8215a4420e9518e8bcda431992c9fbfb2f2737a1909e60a2677f72a", "ja": "あれ？　{$P$}。\nそれにみんなも！　珍しいトコで会ったな。", "zh": "咦？　{$P$}。\n还有大家也在！　居然在这种少见的地方碰上了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1029_p", "source_sha256": "ddc5a42fa2b82bf488d65005cf1d1bc7d259f1fd47bc391c3097880348c8ab88", "ja": "ジュリアじゃないか。\nもしかして、よく来てるのか？", "zh": "这不是茱莉亚吗？  \n你该不会经常来这里吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "7de314cc0cdba58dec45260053c5e7c208effebb3c164d08e20261f392b25bc3", "ja": "ああ、ここは品揃えがいいからね。あたしは、\n今日はギターの弦を買いに来たんだけど……そっちは？", "zh": "嗯，这里的商品种类很齐全嘛。我今天是来买吉他弦的……你呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "0c75eb829f19091e05f252daa5e1df99dabd91cd557c0432317bb3c658c7cc54", "ja": "それなんだけど、実は……。", "zh": "说到这个，其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "973046f852f1cc3f8243836bf54a4811d3226d1df825196b3103584ebb8b9243", "ja": "なるほど……それで可奈が、楽器の講師も\nやってくれるってわけか。いいじゃないか！", "zh": "原来如此……所以可奈也会来当乐器老师啊。不错嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1033_009rit", "source_sha256": "aca7f224fb7c223d6b63684824083ebab3f6f63b83dcc4759c3c29262dfbe5db", "ja": "ただ、楽器選びが難航しててね……。ねえジュリア、\n初心者にオススメの楽器って何かしら？", "zh": "不过，选乐器这事进展得不太顺利……对了，茱莉亚，你觉得有没有什么适合初学者的乐器？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1034_050jul", "source_sha256": "f3d08cb19dd09bf81eddda52881c2bfcebdcc757e9338ae6ea39b5247b8cbc0a", "ja": "そうだな……。\n例えば、こいつなんかいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "这个嘛……  \n比如，这个不就挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "cbdb73e97093a14d0a354329ae44bf47b3594136897fe0d75093b1f82d237a4e", "ja": "カスタネット……えええええっ！　そ、それは\nいくらなんでもカンタンすぎませんか！？", "zh": "响板……诶诶诶诶！这、这未免也太简单了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1036_050jul", "source_sha256": "284d2c745fb86d927dbc192845b2872daf8c3ed68a0110ede2be6d754942f0ae", "ja": "打楽器をなめるなよ？　こういう単純なものほど、\n基礎が詰まってるんだ。意外と難しいんだぜ？", "zh": "别小看打击乐器啊？越是这种简单的东西，越是蕴含着基础。其实意外地难呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1037_019min", "source_sha256": "7d8c978b93f4df78c5089ef9f84a2fa62ee9dfea1f554bd9ffa8f964cde7a298", "ja": "そういえば可奈ちゃんも、打楽器が\nオススメだって言ってたような……？", "zh": "说起来，可奈好像也说过，推荐打击乐器来着……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1038_009rit", "source_sha256": "3dee63b97697090180e4248b9db5001abff9735365b42ff7f301859fb0ab8531", "ja": "そうだったわ。ついテンションが上がっちゃってたけど\n本来こういうものを買いに来たはずだったのよね……。", "zh": "对了。刚才不知不觉就兴奋起来了，本来应该是来买这种东西的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1039_019min", "source_sha256": "ef1435ab69eeae1ac318b085394c759395cb6c25ada922c798a5376c26ef175f", "ja": "だったら……私は、シンバルかな？\nなんだかお鍋のフタっぽくて、親近感を覚えるかも♪", "zh": "那样的话……我选镲吧？\n感觉有点像锅盖，说不定会产生亲切感呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1040_035hin", "source_sha256": "a54c960a7da18d7f1c82b76b7608104e0345ebb43a016d285637b870b618c7de", "ja": "あたしは、マラカスにしようかねぇ。\n振ってるだけで、なんだか元気が出るべさ！", "zh": "我就选沙锤吧。\n光是摇一摇，就感觉精神起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1041_050jul", "source_sha256": "4391c6ae60229248c92eed51e551715382cb754a923b49de6740955b0e41bda2", "ja": "うん、いいチョイスじゃないか！\nリツ姉と亜利沙は、どうするんだ？", "zh": "嗯，选得不错嘛！\n律姐和亚利沙打算怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1042_009rit", "source_sha256": "961b07cb88d34bb6499446ea9e66160cd32ac5fe7ce8a14fd783dc9e06f63b48", "ja": "みんなが楽器なら、私はタクトにしようかしら。\n全体のバランスを見る指揮者も必要でしょ？", "zh": "既然大家选乐器，那我就选指挥棒吧。\n总得需要一个掌控整体平衡的指挥家嘛，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1043_009rit", "source_sha256": "a5cbc81d159a5e4ca0e0a638ca9b2baac85df610251d197cd213a35b9d26659c", "ja": "亜利沙は？　何か、やりたい楽器が……。", "zh": "亚利沙呢？有没有什么想演奏的乐器……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1044_028ari", "source_sha256": "27094731a1907fd97be485397aa8792ba036e74e7a7ce92c3f05b10c3c27286b", "ja": "あっ！\nちょ、ちょっと待ってくださ～い！", "zh": "啊！\n请、请稍等一下～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1045_009rit", "source_sha256": "f9ebfb4edfdef55a8244c84a87797c580649df7bd1869d72bc0a870bd1073e7e", "ja": "亜利沙……今、何か隠したわね？\nちょっと見せなさい。", "zh": "亚利沙……你刚才是不是藏了什么？\n让我看一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1046_028ari", "source_sha256": "341dc647f5b7e8853e8399333c137b74cb40a4e1fbb7d42355ea3030ce3ae7aa", "ja": "うう、はい……。", "zh": "呜呜，好的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1047_009rit", "source_sha256": "48fbabe2cc18d380c6881596daab722f5cfd18f17fc22d25022507af5958fc9b", "ja": "デジカメ……もしかして私達が買い物している間も、\nこっそりカメラを回していたのね？", "zh": "数码相机……难道我们买东西的时候，你也一直偷偷在拍吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1048_p", "source_sha256": "822fe16f7335b3bfd86f733ff814bdb2c79d0e79be31662a1749eb594bdbbba7", "ja": "お店に来てから、\nどうもおとなしいなと思ったら……。", "zh": "来到店里后，我还在想怎么一直这么安静，原来是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1049_028ari", "source_sha256": "c9114d38aa5f31075846e84baf10d8aa4cc82c51ac9cea7dc6bc1636fd83ed83", "ja": "いやっ、店内撮影OKとあったものですから……\nそ、それにこれは、特典のためですし！？", "zh": "不、不是因为店里写着可以拍摄嘛……\n而、而且这是为了拿特典！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1050_009rit", "source_sha256": "6415d98134ca320b1694bfd572fd938fe97ef3e871e859b3495a9d653d06f2de", "ja": "もちろんそれはわかってるわよ。\nでも、隠し撮りは禁止！", "zh": "我当然明白这点。\n但是，禁止偷拍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1051_028ari", "source_sha256": "159554ab346c07e78a2be641766eeea0b5db6c781278877aa7301b8aa0645e2a", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい～！", "zh": "对、对不起～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1052_p", "source_sha256": "2fd6300e6e3983dd91ce8b892ddf715cf31e8429441e62961bd9c714dab1b4db", "ja": "それで、亜利沙はどうするんだ？　楽器。", "zh": "那么，亜利沙打算怎么办？乐器呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1053_028ari", "source_sha256": "a417e955cc8c96f0f1ae517859ca4584b9d2573372ae30fe7dc953ebcf3214ae", "ja": "ありさは、ええと……あっ、これがいいです！\nこの太鼓にしますっ！", "zh": "亚利沙嘛，那个……啊，这个好！\n就选这面鼓了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1054_028ari", "source_sha256": "10ec78d835a43a8754d7ddf946b01614385a6fe461d3349e6706a113c157bb9c", "ja": "みんなの練習姿を撮影……じゃなくて、\n楽器の練習、がんばりましょうね！　……ムフフ♪", "zh": "把大家练习的英姿拍下……不对，\n是练习乐器，大家要加油哦！……嘿嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1055_050jul", "source_sha256": "9c00010d0933b40c01a46e55f13dcd1902bb8f938cb8c06da3a53ae998c02928", "ja": "亜利沙は相変わらずだなぁ……ま、何にせよ\n楽器が決まってよかったな！", "zh": "亚利沙还是老样子啊……不过不管怎么说，能决定好乐器真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1056_p", "source_sha256": "07e1a45a2e21c725f4b8b3d2e3abd36028e549b74a58592b166ec0676423bbf9", "ja": "ああ、ありがとうジュリア。\n助かったよ！", "zh": "啊，谢谢你，茱莉亚。\n帮大忙了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0129_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_04_1057_p", "source_sha256": "d3596ab2b5ddbeeb9a2c54af0054f494c3eaaf887a16d2900ff5b0729f3dad47", "ja": "（これで楽器は決まった。\nあとは本番まで、レッスンを重ねるだけだな！）", "zh": "（乐器已经决定好了。接下来只要在正式演出前不断练习就行了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
